{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2b524a7f5c83f11d6c17e5e14348d22bfe7b22e85769a0054786e17a84dcfea7", "ja": "（大盛況で終了した『D/Zeal』の公演。評判を\nチェックしているけど、かなりいいようだな！）", "zh": "（『D/Zeal』的公演在一片盛况中落下帷幕。现在正在查看评价，看来相当不错啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "81c56fdde5817ce73afc31e8a0b70216ac5a17e399801db873b91ad7af13f956", "ja": "お疲れ、{$P$}。\nなあ、ちょっといいか？　お願いがあるんだけど。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n那个，方便吗？我有件事想拜托你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "c9fce5c7688175d1282486bed549e23e1779d94fb37431025074708a988e08bc", "ja": "この前のウチらの公演、記録用に撮ってたよな？\n映像、ちょっと見せてほしいんだけど。", "zh": "前阵子的演出，你有拍下来留作记录吧？\n我想看看录像，可以给我看一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1f1e30630fdd505546906d4e4f4f93d1fad6731dddf64f638a5b2236279682c0", "ja": "うん？　別に構わないけど……急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？倒是没什么，不过……怎么突然想看这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "cf260057753fa7ef60d09afbce742ede18a60723aae59724e0f731ed03476794", "ja": "んー、見返したいところがあるっていうか、\nえっと……。", "zh": "嗯——该说是有想回看的地方呢，\n还是说……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "96624337cdd881927cbf8ee6da94634487f701a9f01b13bbc431040b5fc0b61c", "ja": "ま、あんただから言うけど。\nちょっと反省会をしようと思ってさ。", "zh": "嘛，因为是你的话我才说的。\n我想开个小小的复盘会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4ee89c761f49c3610b8b82fad1399dec1a93dc9fd70b44f4a94b82e2cfd3360d", "ja": "反省会？", "zh": "复盘会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "abf195ba3f67fb0756d7d665475698bd49841c033da7a328b6edaf9f5651185f", "ja": "ああ。この前の公演は、サイコーの出来だった。\n熱いライブになったと思うよ。", "zh": "啊。之前的公演，表现得棒极了。\n我觉得那是一场热血沸腾的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "757a342c43dc4a58211a501352329994408678e33b925dfbcc4e087622143e07", "ja": "公演中のあたしは、めちゃくちゃ必死だった。\nシズのパフォーマンスが、ずっと良くなってたからさ。", "zh": "演出开始后，我可是拼了命在努力。因为静香的表现一直在变得越来越好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "c555339991541f19e500ced6bc92dd1795d7f0588ad0dd695c88d60fc219b818", "ja": "油断したら、一気に食われちまうんじゃないかって、\n結構ヒヤヒヤしてたんだ。", "zh": "要是一不小心，就会被她一下子彻底压过吧，我当时可是相当捏了把汗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1010_p", "source_sha256": "078ecc03d12e4d1dccf6b29f563ee4866a36ccb5ebe6124c9e67c0e96cb612bd", "ja": "そうなのか？\n袖で見てたけど、そんな風には見えなかったな……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n我在侧台看着，倒没觉得有那么夸张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "17ea882db1ae27ffed2e62c3b40d151fc147fceafd5cd65e7ab1aa91a097c8e2", "ja": "ははっ、そりゃそうさ。\nあたしにも意地があるからな！", "zh": "哈哈，那当然。\n我也是有骨气的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "4498fbf46b675b16ab4a1bedfeab9349d7e884d345ddeb855e12535daecd3e29", "ja": "そう、あたしだって食われるワケにはいかないんだ。\nだから、今できることをしないとな。", "zh": "没错，我也不能就这样被吃掉啊。\n所以，得做些现在能做的事才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1013_p", "source_sha256": "86ec3b3544fa447c0dcb6adabb32212a8a83f1df12c77ea29b58492f7a618ae1", "ja": "なるほど……それなら、もう少し待っててくれるか？\n仕事が落ち着いたら、一緒に反省会をしよう。", "zh": "原来如此……这样的话，能再等我一会儿吗？\n等工作告一段落后，我们一起开个反省会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "cf6aa5d8ef5f8913191e5843acbdbd0b37a622b5e4b61385544beda08d950789", "ja": "えっ？　い、いや、貸してくれるだけでいいって！\nあんたが一緒なんて、落ち着かないしさ……。", "zh": "诶？不、不是，只要借给我就行了！\n要是你也一起，我会静不下心来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a7dc74be60b47e71c54a3812e6b2aa2e7af7e413e97b3d9edcae6ebeffecee9c", "ja": "そんなの、今さらじゃないか。\n客観的な意見も、参考になると思うぞ。", "zh": "这不是早就这样了吗？客观的意见应该也能作为参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "a06cab225c3259f180c15e07ac983031da594f1b3212fdd8c8ca18bd0e9258be", "ja": "くっ……まあ、それは一理あるな……。\nオッケー、わかった。覚悟決めるよ。", "zh": "可恶……不过，你说得也有道理……\n好，知道了。我做好心理准备了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0213_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "25449448e17d949c40f1070ad90e850a982e504f313cf032fc1f2ff6a744d88d", "ja": "仕事が終わるまで待っててやる。\nその代わり、ちゃんとタメになる意見、出してくれよ！", "zh": "我会等到工作结束。\n作为交换，你可得好好提出些有用的意见啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
